# The live plant extracts. ~72MB of production workbooks, deliberately not
# committed: the Plate Tracker opens every workbook in the browser, so no page
# needs them on the server, and shipping them would bloat a Vercel deployment
# for nothing.
#
# sheets-schema/ IS committed — small fixtures covering the same columns and the
# same awkward row shapes, so the tests and the integrity checks run anywhere.
# Regenerate with: npm run fixtures:make
sheets/

